Refine authentication messaging and expose profile-creation result

- `ensureUserProfile()` now returns `{ profile, created }` using
  `ref.create()` plus a retry read so concurrent first-time logins
  cannot overwrite an existing profile.
- `LoginForm` shows neutral "Signing you in..." / "Please wait while we
  securely sign you in." text until the session is established.
- Returning users now see "Signing you in..." / "Signing in as <email>."
- New users see "Setting up your account..." / "Creating your Saba Water
  Delivery profile." before the normal portal redirect.
- `client-session.ts` and `api/auth/session/route.ts` now pass the
  `created` flag through to the client.
- Portal routing and Driver Registry authorization remain unchanged.

